      "content": "The element that usually does NOT show variable oxidation states is : ",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "V"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "Cu"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "Sc"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "ti"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": "Sc<sup>3+</sup> has noble gas configuration hence only +3 exists.\n<br><br>Most common oxidation states of :\n<br><br/>(i) Sc : +3\n<br><br/>(ii) V : +2, +3, +4, +5\n<br><br/>(iii) Ti : +2, +3, +4\n<br><br/>(iv) Cu : +1, +2"
